Spec: Tests

Purpose:
  Automated `pytest` tests for the `aikana` package, run without a network or a running server.

Structure:
  ./conftest.py: shared fixtures wiring an in-process client and every feature's services on a temporary database,
    plus the shared assertions that a page's day calendar has a given day checked and that slice one week card out
    of the weekly view
  ./test_auth.py: in-process client tests of the admin login and logout, the shell's login/logout link and the
    password's secrecy
  ./test_conferences.py: service-layer validation tests for the Conference package, in-process client tests of the
    day dialog's Conference tab with its admin guard, and of the wall planner's purple Conference title and the
    weekly view's Conference flag
  ./test_courses.py: in-process client tests of the courses page, its create form and its edit and delete dialogs
  ./test_dates.py: unit tests for the shared Europe/Helsinki date policy
  ./test_deadlines.py: service-layer validation tests for the Deadline package, in-process client tests of the
    weekly view's Deadlines section with its add, edit and delete dialogs and their admin guard, and tests of the
    wall planner's deadline circles with their tooltips
  ./test_day_dialog.py: in-process client tests of the admin day dialog's forms, its guard, its grid and
    week-cards swaps and the weekly view's lesson-only dialog, and of editing and removing the Holiday and
    NoTeachWeek already on the clicked date
  ./test_main.py: in-process client tests of the app entry point, the semester routes and the wall planner's
    rendering
  ./test_mcp_server.py: unit tests for the MCP package's write guard and service mapping, and in-process JSON-RPC
    tests of the `/mcp` endpoint's anonymous reads and token-gated writes
  ./test_no_teach_weeks.py: unit tests for the NoTeachWeek package's pure domain rules
  ./test_realizations.py: in-process client tests of the courses page's add, edit and delete realization dialogs, of
    the weekly view's states, fallbacks, week cards, view bar with the realization selector and Share button and
    Holiday flags, and of its click-to-edit Lesson dialogs, its per-week Lesson add trigger and the note read under
    a Lesson
  ./test_schema.py: data-integrity tests of the SQLite schema's foreign keys with cascade, unique constraints,
    NOT NULL columns, STRICT types and integer primary keys
  ./test_semester_domain.py: unit tests for the Semester package's pure domain rules
  ./test_services.py: service-layer validation tests against temporary databases, and the default NoTeachWeeks and
    public holidays a created Semester starts with
  ./test_shared.py: tests of the shared kernel's database factory, page shell and its Monday-first day calendar,
    and of the hand-written stylesheet being linked and served
  ./test_week_themes.py: service-layer validation tests for the WeekTheme package and in-process client tests of the
    weekly view's week theme, its add, edit and delete dialogs and their admin guard

Owns:
  ./test_*.py
  ./conftest.py

Depends on:
  /src/aikana/aikana.sdd

Must:
  Tests exercise the app through an in-process client and leave no files behind in the repository.
  Tests never touch `/data`: they build each app or service on a temporary database through @create_app and
  @create_database, which is possible because importing `aikana.main` has no side effects.
  ./test_schema.py asserts the schema's foreign keys, unique indexes, NOT NULL columns and STRICT types directly,
  so dropping one of those constraints fails the suite even when the services still check it in Python.
